{"bvid": "BV1QL411j72S", "title": "突破英语听力口语瓶颈08｜掌握语调6大规则，扭转枯燥腔调", "duration": 292, "subs": [{"cid": 465495812, "lan": "ai-zh", "n": 102, "body": [{"from": 0.12, "to": 3.599, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "语调是一个人声音的升降"}, {"from": 3.599, "to": 8.019, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "许多英语学习者认为所有的英语问题都有一个上升的音调"}, {"from": 8.019, "to": 11.12, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "所有的英语陈述都有一个下降的音高"}, {"from": 11.12, "to": 11.82, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "事实上"}, {"from": 11.82, "to": 13.08, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "这是不正确的"}, {"from": 13.08, "to": 17.32, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "语调模式比你想象的有更多的细微差别"}, {"from": 17.32, "to": 19.8, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "英语语调的规则是什么？"}, {"from": 19.8, "to": 22.2, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "我会让你在这个视频中被覆盖"}, {"from": 24.36, "to": 27.5, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "当涉及到以下六种句子时"}, {"from": 27.5, "to": 30.72, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "你必须选择合适的语调模式"}, {"from": 35.97, "to": 37.23, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "当你完成一个想法"}, {"from": 37.23, "to": 38.93, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "或者你对某事很确定"}, {"from": 38.93, "to": 41.65, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "你用降调对焦"}, {"from": 41.65, "to": 43.53, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "思想群体中的话语"}, {"from": 43.53, "to": 45.33, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "你们什么时候可以见面？"}, {"from": 45.33, "to": 47.17, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "这个星期我什么时候都有空"}, {"from": 47.17, "to": 47.83, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "伟大"}, {"from": 47.83, "to": 51.03, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "明天早上怎么样？可以"}, {"from": 51.03, "to": 51.57, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "再见"}, {"from": 51.57, "to": 52.18, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "然后呢"}, {"from": 52.28, "to": 53.34, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "相比之下"}, {"from": 53.34, "to": 57.74, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "一个思想小组结束时上升的语调显示出不确定性"}, {"from": 57.74, "to": 60.4, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "对确认的惊讶或渴望"}, {"from": 60.4, "to": 61.6, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "今天看起来"}, {"from": 61.6, "to": 62.52, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "你妈妈的生日"}, {"from": 63.72, "to": 65.94, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "今天是我妈妈的生日"}, {"from": 66.32, "to": 67.84, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "两个踢踏舞问题"}, {"from": 68.88, "to": 72.68, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "点击问题是以简短问题结尾的陈述"}, {"from": 72.68, "to": 77.65, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "结尾的简短问题可以有上升或下降的音高"}, {"from": 77.65, "to": 82.53, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "它们被用来确认信息或要求澄清"}, {"from": 82.53, "to": 84.21, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "如果你认为你知道什么"}, {"from": 84.21, "to": 86.91, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "但需要听众的确认"}, {"from": 86.91, "to": 90.14, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "让一个声音落在问题标签里"}, {"from": 90.26, "to": 91.68, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "她不进来"}, {"from": 91.68, "to": 94.34, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "她不进来吗？"}, {"from": 94.34, "to": 96.46, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "但你住在中国"}, {"from": 96.46, "to": 97.56, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "不是吗"}, {"from": 97.56, "to": 99.34, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "你住在中国"}, {"from": 99.34, "to": 100.58, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "不是吗"}, {"from": 100.74, "to": 102.84, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "如果你相信某件事可能是真的"}, {"from": 102.84, "to": 104.26, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "但你不确定"}, {"from": 104.26, "to": 106.94, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "让一个声音在问题标签中升起"}, {"from": 106.94, "to": 110.009, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "以便侦听器知道您想要更多信息"}, {"from": 110.009, "to": 111.289, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "她不进来"}, {"from": 111.289, "to": 114.38, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "她不进来吗？"}, {"from": 115.2, "to": 116.4, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "你住在中国"}, {"from": 116.4, "to": 117.54, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "不是吗"}, {"from": 117.54, "to": 119.28, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "你住在中国"}, {"from": 119.28, "to": 121.6, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "你们三个不是"}, {"from": 121.6, "to": 122.8, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "是或否问题"}, {"from": 123.84, "to": 128.139, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "音高通常在是或否问题结束时上升"}, {"from": 128.78, "to": 132.9, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "你知道吗？你有戴夫的电话号码吗？"}, {"from": 132.9, "to": 138.42, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "你是去度假还是要求澄清"}, {"from": 138.42, "to": 142.7, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "当你要求澄清别人所说的话时"}, {"from": 142.7, "to": 146.22, "sid": 55, "location": 2, "content": "在短语的末尾使用上升的音高"}, {"from": 146.399, "to": 148.959, "sid": 56, "location": 2, "content": "我今天得去拿她公寓的钥匙"}, {"from": 150.039, "to": 157.22, "sid": 57, "location": 2, "content": "今天不断上升的音高表明利迪想让艾米重复同样的信息"}, {"from": 157.22, "to": 159.08, "sid": 58, "location": 2, "content": "因为莉莉没有听到"}, {"from": 159.08, "to": 160.0, "sid": 59, "location": 2, "content": "艾米说"}, {"from": 160.0, "to": 161.36, "sid": 60, "location": 2, "content": "她不相信什么"}, {"from": 161.36, "to": 162.24, "sid": 61, "location": 2, "content": "艾米说"}, {"from": 162.24, "to": 165.04, "sid": 62, "location": 2, "content": "我今天得去拿她公寓的钥匙"}, {"from": 165.119, "to": 166.999, "sid": 63, "location": 2, "content": "当三个P"}, {"from": 166.999, "to": 167.6, "sid": 64, "location": 2, "content": "m"}, {"from": 167.94, "to": 172.44, "sid": 65, "location": 2, "content": "下面的音高是莉莉要求新信息的信号"}, {"from": 172.44, "to": 174.76, "sid": 66, "location": 2, "content": "所以今天不说"}, {"from": 174.76, "to": 176.46, "sid": 67, "location": 2, "content": "艾米三便士"}, {"from": 176.46, "to": 177.079, "sid": 68, "location": 2, "content": "m"}, {"from": 179.54, "to": 183.45, "sid": 69, "location": 2, "content": "这些问题包括一系列选项"}, {"from": 183.45, "to": 185.01, "sid": 70, "location": 2, "content": "看下面的问题"}, {"from": 185.01, "to": 189.94, "sid": 71, "location": 2, "content": "你可以用两种不同的语调模式来表达不同的意思"}, {"from": 190.4, "to": 192.4, "sid": 72, "location": 2, "content": "你要咖啡还是茶？"}, {"from": 193.56, "to": 195.4, "sid": 73, "location": 2, "content": "你要咖啡还是茶？"}, {"from": 196.16, "to": 197.52, "sid": 74, "location": 2, "content": "在第一个例子中"}, {"from": 197.52, "to": 200.94, "sid": 75, "location": 2, "content": "我只提供咖啡和茶两种疡"}, {"from": 200.94, "to": 203.5, "sid": 76, "location": 2, "content": "这是一个很接近的选择题"}, {"from": 203.6, "to": 205.5, "sid": 77, "location": 2, "content": "所以在一个封闭的问题中"}, {"from": 205.5, "to": 211.54, "sid": 78, "location": 2, "content": "你需要在第一个选项上提高你的音调，让它在最后一个选项之后下降"}, {"from": 211.54, "to": 214.5, "sid": 79, "location": 2, "content": "你要咖啡还是茶？"}, {"from": 217.3, "to": 218.84, "sid": 80, "location": 2, "content": "在第二个例子中"}, {"from": 218.84, "to": 222.15, "sid": 81, "location": 2, "content": "咖啡和茶是你可以拥有的例子"}, {"from": 222.15, "to": 224.63, "sid": 82, "location": 2, "content": "但没有整套选项"}, {"from": 224.63, "to": 227.16, "sid": 83, "location": 2, "content": "这是一道选择题"}, {"from": 227.32, "to": 229.26, "sid": 84, "location": 2, "content": "所以在一个悬而未决的问题中"}, {"from": 229.26, "to": 232.36, "sid": 85, "location": 2, "content": "你不改变你对第一个选择的看法"}, {"from": 232.36, "to": 235.4, "sid": 86, "location": 2, "content": "但在最后的选择之后提高它"}, {"from": 235.5, "to": 237.66, "sid": 87, "location": 2, "content": "你要咖啡还是茶？"}, {"from": 237.66, "to": 240.3, "sid": 88, "location": 2, "content": "嗯哼"}, {"from": 240.38, "to": 242.54, "sid": 89, "location": 2, "content": "六个WH问题"}, {"from": 242.54, "to": 246.34, "sid": 90, "location": 2, "content": "这些问题是从谁开始的"}, {"from": 246.34, "to": 248.6, "sid": 91, "location": 2, "content": "什么在哪里什么时候为什么"}, {"from": 248.6, "to": 253.14, "sid": 92, "location": 2, "content": "以及这些问题通常如何以下降的音高结束"}, {"from": 253.22, "to": 255.12, "sid": 93, "location": 2, "content": "我们去哪里吃饭？"}, {"from": 255.12, "to": 257.1, "sid": 94, "location": 2, "content": "会议什么时候开始"}, {"from": 257.459, "to": 259.059, "sid": 95, "location": 2, "content": "1.你什么时候到这儿的"}, {"from": 259.059, "to": 260.459, "sid": 96, "location": 2, "content": "你女儿多大了？"}, {"from": 261.819, "to": 263.36, "sid": 97, "location": 2, "content": "哒哒哒哒哒"}, {"from": 264.74, "to": 268.78, "sid": 98, "location": 2, "content": "了解更多关于语调在谈话中如何影响我的信息"}, {"from": 268.78, "to": 272.01, "sid": 99, "location": 2, "content": "看一些英美电视节目"}, {"from": 272.01, "to": 276.4, "sid": 100, "location": 2, "content": "以下是我挑选的六个学习英语的最佳电视节目"}, {"from": 280.42, "to": 282.36, "sid": 101, "location": 2, "content": "我希望你喜欢这个教程"}, {"from": 282.36, "to": 284.02, "sid": 102, "location": 2, "content": "我是萨米鲍勃"}]}]}